@startuml system_components
!pragma layout smetana
title Production component boundaries
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor Pilot
package "Game host / Unity" {
  component "KSP vessel and scenes" as Game
  component "KSPSerialIO" as Mod
  component "HmiContext" as Context
  component "kRPC mod (separate dependency)" as RPC
}
component "UNO R4 firmware" as Board
component "Pi C++ HMI" as HMI
Pilot --> Board : buttons / optional axes
Mod --> Game : apply controls
Game --> Mod : sample vessel
Board --> Mod : serial controls / diagnostics
Mod --> Board : serial telemetry / handshake
Game --> RPC : expose vessel API
Game --> Context : scene / facility events
HMI --> RPC : TCP calls + stream registration
RPC --> HMI : TCP stream results
HMI --> Context : UDP KSPHMI/1 request
Context --> HMI : UDP scene reply
HMI --> Pilot : instruments / flight data
Board --> Pilot : LEDs / matrix
@enduml
